          "heading": "Jake White to name final Fiji squad on Friday after Lyon camp",
          "body": "Jake White will name Fiji's final Nations Championship squad on Friday, after a three-day Lyon camp to assess players. Kali Sewabu says White \"wants to see and have a feel of everyone in the current squad\" before deciding. Around 10 players from the 34-28 win over Japan flew straight to Europe, joining Europe-based names including Seta Bituniyata, the Pro D2 Player of the Year. Those players return to club games this weekend and regroup in Lyon, pending injuries."
