          "kicker": "Coaching pressure",
          "heading": "Warren Gatland says Steve Borthwick has 'a lot at stake' this autumn",
          "body": "Warren Gatland has put Steve Borthwick's job security in the spotlight ahead of the Northern Hemisphere leg of the Nations Championship. Speaking to BOYLE Sports, the former Wales and Lions coach said: \"There's a lot at stake in terms of results. You lose and people lose their jobs.\" Gatland, who was on the 2017 Lions with Borthwick, praised his technical ability and said international coaching can take time to build. England's autumn opener is against Australia."
