          "kicker": "Player move",
          "heading": "Gareth Anscombe explains Bayonne exit for Scarlets, citing wish to keep playing",
          "body": "Gareth Anscombe, now 35, says he was weighing his options at the end of the Top 14 season with Bayonne when Scarlets' approach came late in the campaign. \"I felt like I still had another year left in me,\" he said, adding that he did not really want to move his family too much. Dwayne Peel made the first contact, and Anscombe, who quit France for Wales, now plays in the URC for the Llanelli-based side."
