          "kicker": "Injury blow",
          "heading": "Tommaso Menoncello set to miss Italy's autumn Tests with shoulder sprain",
          "body": "Toulouse centre Tommaso Menoncello is set to miss Italy's autumn campaign after suffering a sprained left shoulder when he went off in the 43rd minute of Sunday's 43-40 Champions Cup win over Exeter Chiefs. The injury is expected to keep him out for several weeks, another setback for the 24-year-old after an earlier knock against La Rochelle. Head coach Gonzalo Quesada must now prepare for the autumn without one of his key players, with South Africa, Argentina and Fiji on the calendar."
        },
