          "heading": "Finn Russell urges Scotland to kick on and beat big teams",
          "body": "Finn Russell wants Scotland to kick on and beat the big teams, and he is in Gregor Townsend's 37-man squad for the Nations Championship. Scotland have yet to beat the All Blacks, who have won 31 of the 33 previous meetings, and the next test is at Murrayfield. Last time out they beat Fiji 33-17."
