          "heading": "Santiago Carreras ruled out for rest of season with knee injury",
          "body": "Santiago Carreras will miss the rest of the season after a serious knee injury suffered playing for Bath last weekend, Reuters reports, leaving Argentina without a utility back ahead of the Nations Championship. He limped off early in Bath's 23-5 defeat to Gloucester and is due a scan on the lower-limb injury. Mateo Soler, who made his test debut off the bench against Australia last month, has replaced him in the squad."
