          "kicker": "Player eligibility",
          "heading": "Les Kiss confirms Wallabies talks with Mark Nawaqanitawase over international future",
          "body": "Les Kiss has spelled out where the Wallabies stand on Mark Nawaqanitawase, who has discussed his eligibility for Fiji and Italy. Speaking on the KOKO show before flying north for the November Nations Championship matches, the coach said Australia want the 26-year-old to know they are there to support him, but he must earn his jersey. Nawaqanitawase has won his maiden NRL title with the Sydney Roosters and joins Saitama Panasonic Wild Knights, so the three-way battle for his allegiance is live heading into Rugby World Cup 2027."
