          "body": "Jake White's first match in charge ended in a 28-34 defeat to Fiji at Prince Chichibunomiya, with Japan level 21-21 at half-time. White, who said he had not coached at international level for 20 years, reflected: \"I'm very excited and relieved as we had a short time with this team.\" His stated priority is control, and the three Nations Championship fixtures against France, Ireland and Italy follow."
