          "kicker": "Injury frustration",
          "heading": "Anton Segner says two injuries have been tough mentally ahead of tour",
          "body": "Rookie Anton Segner says the ankle and head injury assessment setbacks that have kept him out have been hard going. Speaking on the Aotearoa Rugby Pod ahead of the end-of-year tour to Scotland, Wales and England, the 25-year-old said \"these last two injuries have really been tough on me mentally.\" Capped twice off the bench in July's wins over Italy and Ireland, the German-born back-rower said he is \"looking forward to these next couple games and hoping to get some good game time.\""
        },
